<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle steady to off $1.00--USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle steady to off $1.00--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 lower, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers Medium and Large 1 200-300 lbs 99.00-119.00, mostly 107.00-113.00; 300-400 lbs 99.00-107.00; 400-500 lbs 84.00-94.00; 500-600 lbs 80.50-90.50; 600-700 lbs 79.00-84.00, including 49 head 638 lbs 83.50; 700- 800 lbs 74.00-78.25, including 14 head 720 lbs 78.25; 800-900 lbs 73.50- 78.25, including 16 head 801 lbs 78.25. Small 1 10 head 357 lbs 92.50.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 2 300-400 lbs 86.00-92.00; 400-500 lbs 80.75-85.75; 500-600 lbs 78.50-80.00. Holsteins 300-400 lbs 69.00-76.00; 400-500 lbs few 72.00; 600-700 lbs 58.50- 64.00; 700-800 lbs 54.50-58.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers Medium and Large 1 200-300 lbs 85.00-93.00; 300-400 lbs 83.50-92.00 400-500 lbs 79.50-87.50; 500-600 lbs 75.50-82.25; 600-700 lbs 71.50-77.50, including 12 head 643 lbs 77.50; 700-800 lbs 68.25-73.75.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 2 300-400 lbs 75.00-80.00; 400-500 lbs 73.00-79.00. Feeder Bulls Medium and Large 1 300-400 lbs 84.50-94.50; 400-500 lbs 80.00- 89.50; 500-600 lbs 77.00-84.00; 600-700 lbs 70.00-77.00; 700-800 lbs 68.50-73.50. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs few 77.00. Replacment/feeder cows 9 head Small 1-2 676 lbs 69.00.</p>
<p>Cattle Receipts: 1818</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
